> Manipulate integers as sequences of bits.

name: Position
slug: bookshelf-position
version: 5.0.0
tags: runtime


$scale = float > scaling factor

feature function add/pos
  > Add position scores to the entity’s coordinates.
  authors: Aksiome, Leirof
  contributors: RacoonJohn
  created: 2024/01/22 1.20.4
  updated: 2026/10/14 26.3

  input storage: $scale > scaling factor to apply to the position scores
  output state > entity's coordinates

